# nasa-neo app API
# Environments: local (port 8000), gardener (port-forward via tools/k8s/port-forward.sh, port 8008)

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### NEOs for current week (week 44, 2026)
GET {{baseUrl}}/neo/week/44

### NEOs for current week — hazardous only
GET {{baseUrl}}/neo/week/44?filter=hazardous

### Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats
